description: 'Searches Cortex issues using the provided filters. All filters are applied
  together (pagination fields are not considered filters). Note: If OR logic is needed
  across different fields (e.g., "name contains ''malware'' or description contains
  ''phishing''"), the action should run once per field with the other filters applied.'
